# Process 3, the body of portal.New: its steps in the order it calls them.
# By hand: dfd --box 300x150 --per-row 5 --number --number-prefix 3. docs/flow.3.dfd -o flow.3.svg

{5 Add the Try It setting}
> portal configuration
[3.1. Check the portal configuration and open its content directory
 so that the spec path and the content directory stay inside the documentation root
 (portal.checkConfig)]
    > content directory path
    < content directory handle
    <Documentation root>
>
[3.2. Load the Elements assets
 or refuse to start without them
 (portal.loadAssets)]
> portal configuration, content directory handle, Elements assets
[3.3. Build the router
 that sends each request to the viewer page, the raw spec, the Elements assets,
 with a content directory the document list, a document page or a raw file, and with a chat its routes
 (portal.newRouter)]
> portal
{HTTP server}

# type: portal configuration = portal.Config
# type: content directory handle = io/fs.FS
# type: Elements assets = io/fs.FS
# type: portal = net/http.Handler
